{"id":9565,"bangumiId":9565,"type":2,"name":"ドラゴンボール","name_cn":"龙珠","date":"1986-02-26","year":"1986","region":"jp","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/84/45/9565_s98m3.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/84/45/9565_s98m3.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/84/45/9565_s98m3.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/84/45/9565_s98m3.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/84/45/9565_s98m3.jpg"},"summary":"鸟山明最早在《少年JUMP》周刊连载《龙珠》时，该漫画早期（1-194篇）比较偏重于搞笑，而且打斗一般并不在这儿占主流，因此这个时期，鸟山明的画风对人物性格刻画得很精准，可以让人爆笑起来，因此东映动画公司决定把这个时期的漫画改成一部153集的动画，这也是中国内地在三部《龙珠》系列动画中唯一引进的一部，故也称龙珠TV。而且第一部有很多风格和人物剧情都根源于《西游记》，而且鸟山明的前作《阿拉蕾》中的人物也有客串。","rating":{"rank":119,"total":6258,"count":{"1":8,"2":7,"3":4,"4":12,"5":53,"6":272,"7":1108,"8":2299,"9":1550,"10":945},"score":8.2},"collection":{"on_hold":471,"dropped":174,"wish":808,"collect":10682,"doing":390},"tags":[{"name":"童年","count":1532,"total_count":94374},{"name":"龙珠","count":1212,"total_count":6621},{"name":"鸟山明","count":1038,"total_count":3200},{"name":"热血","count":760,"total_count":219035},{"name":"TV","count":594,"total_count":1450154},{"name":"JUMP","count":475,"total_count":33806},{"name":"热血系","count":445,"total_count":6133},{"name":"战斗","count":413,"total_count":491711},{"name":"1986","count":388,"total_count":4385},{"name":"龟派气功","count":381,"total_count":417},{"name":"东映","count":329,"total_count":21266},{"name":"漫画改","count":305,"total_count":894202},{"name":"孙悟空","count":236,"total_count":1049},{"name":"神作","count":216,"total_count":48414},{"name":"漫改","count":130,"total_count":370621},{"name":"日本","count":94,"total_count":316882},{"name":"神龙","count":63,"total_count":63},{"name":"1986年","count":47,"total_count":191},{"name":"童年系","count":45,"total_count":1721},{"name":"经典","count":37,"total_count":23340},{"name":"東映アニメーション","count":36,"total_count":10084},{"name":"冒险","count":34,"total_count":57385},{"name":"奇幻","count":30,"total_count":494119},{"nam